OL,3,GNEWSAPier safety work to start as
OL,4,Arestoration on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FSafety work on a 146-year-old pier is
OL,7,Fexpected to start next week after
OL,8,Fengineers identified an "immediate
OL,9,Frisk" to people in the water below.
OL,11,FContractors will begin removing about
OL,12,F600 metal floor grilles from the lower
OL,13,Flevel of timber landing stages at
OL,14,FBournemouth Pier on Monday.
OL,16,FIt follows Bournemouth Christchurch and
OL,17,FPoole (BCP) Council's decision to
OL,18,Fprioritise safety after rising costs
OL,19,Fand an unsuccessful tender delayed
OL,20,Fplans for a wider restoration project
OL,21,Fat the Dorset landmark.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
