OL,3,GNEWSAPier safety work to start as
OL,4,Arestoration on hold
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Herrett, the council's cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for the seafront, said the
OL,8,Fimmediate priority was "the most urgent
OL,9,Fsafety works" to protect people in and
OL,10,Faround the water.
